WEBVTT

00:00:01.385 --> 00:00:03.912
English: Hi! Is there a pharmacy open around here?

00:00:04.805 --> 00:00:06.886
Twain: ¿Hay una farmacia abierta por aquí?

00:00:07.709 --> 00:00:11.571
Español: Sí, hay una a dos cuadras, junto al café.

00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:16.428
Twain: Yes. There's one about two blocks away. Next to the cafe.

00:00:17.305 --> 00:00:19.368
English: Perfect. Thank you so much!

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:22.433
Twain: Perfecto. Muchas gracias.

00:00:23.259 --> 00:00:26.216
Español: ¡De nada! Que tenga un buen día.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.268
Twain: You're welcome. Have a good day.
